Dear Tao,

Would you please consider reading the documentation for decideTests?  If 
you did that, you would know that limma does in fact offer options for 
doing multiple comparison adjustments across contrasts within a gene as 
well across genes.

I have also previously explained on this list why adjustments within a 
gene might not be needed when controlling FDR.

Best wishes
Gordon

